  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Cultural Heritage Janjeva-UNDP-KOS-00129755</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There is a consensus that Janjev&#xeb;/Janjevo&#x2019;s cultural heritage must be recorded, protected, and promoted. It can be used as a driver for socio-economic recovery, particularly when coupled with tangible heritage, natural heritage and intangible heritage which can be found in the surrounding area. In this context, the overall purpose of the project is to use cultural heritage as a driver for the socio-economic revival of Janjev&#xeb;/Janjevo, with a focus on the Croat community through development oppor</narrative>
  </description>
